  "id": "brussels-sprouts-with-mushrooms",
  "name": "Brussels Sprouts with Mushrooms",
  "subtitle": "Tender sprouts with browned mushrooms and lemon",
  "description": "Boiled Brussels sprouts are finished with buttery mushrooms, parsley, and fresh lemon juice.",
